---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Meridian"
  description="How Meridian Digital LLC collects, uses, and retains information submitted through bymeridian.com."
>
  <header class="bg-dark text-on-dark pt-28 pb-14 md:pt-36">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-on-dark-muted">Last updated: 2 September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="bg-paper py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="prose prose-meridian mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.legalName} operates {SITE.domain} and related client tools. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Sprint and contact inquiries</strong> — company website, work email, and optional name, plus the page that sent the form.</li>
        <li><strong>Client accounts</strong> — credentials and monitoring inputs for teams on Monitor. Passwords are hashed.</li>
        <li><strong>Site analytics</strong> — page views and events (CTA clicks, form start/submit/success/error) via Google Analytics. We do not send the contents of form fields as event parameters except coarse metadata such as form source.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        To reply to your inquiry, to deliver a Sprint or Monitor engagement, to operate the client application, and to understand which pages help a buyer decide. We do not sell personal data. We share it with processors only as needed to send email and run the site (for example, email delivery and hosting).
      </p>

      <h2>Client research data</h2>
      <p>
        During a Sprint or Monitor we query public search and AI answer surfaces using your category, competitors, and buyer questions. That output is used for your engagement. It is not sold.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The marketing site may set analytics cookies via Google Analytics. The client application uses a session cookie to keep you signed in.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiry emails are kept as needed to respond and operate the business, typically up to 12 months unless a client relationship continues. You can request deletion at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access, correction, or deletion of personal data we hold. Email {SITE.email}. We respond within five business days.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
